{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883470/extras/2d5fb5b857535d1fb356847bb10a9fdd.avif?t=1767380104\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOR.OP: Dark Shades by SNRCStudios is an extremely realistic multiplayer shooter that immerses you in intense PvP battles with stunning graphics and lifelike environments.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every shadow, every explosion, and every weapon is crafted with utmost precision \u2013 for a visual experience that pulls you right into the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience realistic ballistics, precise gunplay, and a vast arsenal of customizable weapons that make every shot count.<br><br><strong>EXTEME ACTION!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883470/extras/0374d9c9ae7a336792f40db29da60d0c.poster.avif?t=1767380104\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883470/extras/0374d9c9ae7a336792f40db29da60d0c.webm?t=1767380104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883470/extras/0374d9c9ae7a336792f40db29da60d0c.mp4?t=1767380104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight on over 40 richly detailed maps ranging from urban battlefields to open landscapes and military bases \u2013 each with unique tactical challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven thrilling game modes such as Team Deathmatch, Free For All, Domination, Skirmish, Gun Game, and a challenging Zombie mode with over 10 episodes guarantee varied and intense action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>SOR.OP: Dark Shades demands skill, teamwork, and strategy \u2013 are you ready for the ultimate fight?</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883470?t=1767380104","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883470/5d29c2023db04ea58e03355b3c11d0c0758f1ad6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767380104","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883470/65ab745b8fbe5d0218869e6cf092833d12e9ce73/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767380104","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883470/65ab745b8fbe5d0218869e6cf092833d12e9ce73/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767380104","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"SOR.OP: Dark Shades features realistically portrayed violence in a military-dystopian context. This includes: Intense battles with realistic weapons, depiction of blood, and death scenes Violent portrayals against enemy NPCs, including melee attacks Gloomy plot elements that deal with themes such as war trauma, moral gray areas, and civil conflicts In certain game modes (e.g., Zombies), increased violence and disturbing atmosphere may occur The game does not contain sexual content, sexual acts, or nudity. Drug or alcohol abuse, self-harm, or depictions of sexual assault are not part of the game."},"demos":[{"appid":3884320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883470/extras/2d5fb5b857535d1fb356847bb10a9fdd.avif?t=1767380104\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\